          <section id="canvas-empty" class="canvas-empty" aria-labelledby="canvas-empty-title" hidden><h2 id="canvas-empty-title">导入文件，开始标注</h2><p>图片和 PPT 都可以。拖到这里，或用 Ctrl+V 粘贴截图。</p><div class="canvas-empty-actions"><button id="empty-import-file" class="button primary">${t(`upload`,17)}导入图片或 PPT</button><button id="empty-open-project" class="button subtle">从项目库打开</button></div><ol class="workflow-overview"><li><span>1</span>导入文件</li><li><span>2</span>圈选要求</li><li><span>3</span>导出交接</li><li><span>4</span>核对结果</li></ol><p class="canvas-empty-note">项目自动保存到统一文件夹，可在“项目库”中查找。</p></section>
